  "html": "<p>Self Buffs are <a href=\"/wiki/Skills\" title=\"Skills\">skills</a> that increase various character stats. They need to be placed into the skill bar and then cast by the player like any other spell. They have a level-determinant duration which resets every time you place them or move them around on the skill bar. This prevents the player from casting the spell and then quickly removing and adding the skill to re-cast earlier.\n</p><p>Please make note that the Self Buff Resistances (such as Fire Resistance) are not the same as <a href=\"/wiki/Passive\" title=\"Passive\">Passive</a> Wards (such as Fire Ward); Resistance skills only increase their respective resistance ratings for a set amount of time and do not decrease other Resistance ratings like Wards do.\n</p><p><br/>\n<small>This list is sortable. Click the button next to the heading you wish to sort by. A 2 column sort is also possible, by first sorting one column then the second. </small>\n</p>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"sortable\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<tr>\n<th class=\"unsortable\">Icon\n</th><th>Skill Name\n</th><th>Class\n</th><th class=\"unsortable\"># of Ranks\n</th><th class=\"unsortable\">Cool Down Time\n</th><th>Description\n</th><th class=\"unsortable\">Weapon Req'd\n</th><th>Element\n</th><th>Level First Available\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/1h-swivel-arm-action.png\" title=\"Image:1h-swivel-arm-action.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:1h-swivel-arm-action.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/1h-swivel-arm-action.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/1H_Swivel_Arm_Action\" title=\"1H Swivel Arm Action\">1H Swivel Arm Action</a>\n</td><td>Fighter\n</td><td>10\n</td><td>80\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">Improve Attack Speed with 1H weapons\n</td><td>Melee\n</td><td>N/A\n</td><td>5\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/2h-swivel-arm-action.png\" title=\"Image:2h-swivel-arm-action.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:2h-swivel-arm-action.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/2h-swivel-arm-action.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/2H_Swivel_Arm_Action\" title=\"2H Swivel Arm Action\">2H Swivel Arm Action</a>\n</td><td>Fighter\n</td><td>10\n</td><td>80\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">Improve Attack Speed with 2H Weapons\n</td><td>Melee\n</td><td>N/A\n</td><td>5\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Dark_Conniption.png\" title=\"Image:Dark_Conniption.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Dark_Conniption.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Dark_Conniption.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Dark_Conniption\" title=\"Dark Conniption\">Dark Conniption</a>\n</td><td>Fighter\n</td><td>10\n</td><td>N/A\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">Chance to deal Shadow Damage and Increase Attack Speed but Decrease Defense and Stun Resistance\n</td><td>Shield\n</td><td>Shadow\n</td><td>36\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Divine-ascendancy.png\" title=\"Image:Divine-ascendancy.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Divine-ascendancy.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Divine-ascendancy.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Divine_Ascendancy\" title=\"Divine Ascendancy\">Divine Ascendancy</a>\n</td><td>Fighter\n</td><td>15\n</td><td>80\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">Increases all Divine Damage\n</td><td>No\n</td><td>Divine\n</td><td>12\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Divine-resistance.png\" title=\"Image:Divine-resistance.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Divine-resistance.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Divine-resistance.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Divine_Resistance\" title=\"Divine Resistance\">Divine Resistance</a>\n</td><td>Fighter\n</td><td>20\n</td><td>varies\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">Increases Divine Resistance\n</td><td>No\n</td><td>Divine\n</td><td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Heal_self_not_Other.png\" title=\"Image:Heal_self_not_Other.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Heal_self_not_Other.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Heal_self_not_Other.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Heal_Self,_not_Other\" title=\"Heal Self, not Other\">Heal Self, not Other</a>\n</td><td>Fighter\n</td><td>5\n</td><td>80\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">Regenerates Health\n</td><td>No\n</td><td>N/A\n</td><td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Light_in_the_Loafers.png\" title=\"Image:Light_in_the_Loafers.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Light_in_the_Loafers.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Light_in_the_Loafers.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Light_in_the_Loafers\" title=\"Light in the Loafers\">Light in the Loafers</a>\n</td><td>Fighter\n</td><td>4\n</td><td>varies\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">Ignores any negative speed modifiers\n</td><td>No\n</td><td>N/A\n</td><td>10\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Offensive-gesture.png\" title=\"Image:Offensive-gesture.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Offensive-gesture.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Offensive-gesture.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Offensive_Gesture\" title=\"Offensive Gesture\">Offensive Gesture</a>\n</td><td>Fighter\n</td><td>5\n</td><td>45\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">Increases Monster Aggro\n</td><td>No\n</td><td>N/A\n</td><td>25\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Retribution.png\" title=\"Image:Retribution.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Retribution.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Retribution.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Retribution\" title=\"Retribution\">Retribution</a>\n</td><td>Fighter\n</td><td>5\n</td><td>varies\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">Reflects Melee Damage\n</td><td>No\n</td><td>N/A\n</td><td>11\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Thickheadedness.png\" title=\"Image:Thickheadedness.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Thickheadedness.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Thickheadedness.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Thickheadedness\" title=\"Thickheadedness\">Thickheadedness</a>\n</td><td>Fighter\n</td><td>10\n</td><td>varies\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">Increases Stun Resistance\n</td><td>No\n</td><td>N/A\n</td><td>7\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Poison-resistance.png\" title=\"Image:Poison-resistance.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Poison-resistance.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Poison-resistance.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Poison_Resistance\" title=\"Poison Resistance\">Poison Resistance</a>\n</td><td>Ranger\n</td><td>20\n</td><td>varies\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">Increases Poison Resistance\n</td><td>No\n</td><td>Poison\n</td><td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Spirit-of-the-hare.png\" title=\"Image:Spirit-of-the-hare.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Spirit-of-the-hare.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Spirit-of-the-hare.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Spirit_of_the_Hare\" title=\"Spirit of the Hare\">Spirit of the Hare</a>\n</td><td>Ranger\n</td><td>5\n</td><td>90\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">Increases Movement Speed\n</td><td>No\n</td><td>N/A\n</td><td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Toxic-talent.png\" title=\"Image:Toxic-talent.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Toxic-talent.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Toxic-talent.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Toxic_Talent\" title=\"Toxic Talent\">Toxic Talent</a>\n</td><td>Ranger\n</td><td>15\n</td><td>80\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">Increases all Poison Damage\n</td><td>No\n</td><td>Poison\n</td><td>12\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Trigger-finger.png\" title=\"Image:Trigger-finger.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Trigger-finger.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Trigger-finger.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Trigger_Finger_Frenzy\" title=\"Trigger Finger Frenzy\">Trigger Finger Frenzy</a>\n</td><td>Ranger\n</td><td>10\n</td><td>45\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">Improves Attack Speed with ranged weapons\n</td><td>Ranged\n</td><td>N/A\n</td><td>5\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Blue_Screen_of_Life.png\" title=\"Image:Blue_Screen_of_Life.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Blue_Screen_of_Life.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Blue_Screen_of_Life.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Blue_Screen_of_Life\" title=\"Blue Screen of Life\">Blue Screen of Life</a>\n</td><td>Mage\n</td><td>6\n</td><td>30\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">Transfers Health damage to Mana\n</td><td>No\n</td><td>N/A\n</td><td>25\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Chilling-touch.png\" title=\"Image:Chilling-touch.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Chilling-touch.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Chilling-touch.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Chilling_Touch\" title=\"Chilling Touch\">Chilling Touch</a>\n</td><td>Mage\n</td><td>15\n</td><td>80\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">Increases all Ice Damage\n</td><td>No\n</td><td>Ice\n</td><td>12\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Dark-wizardry.png\" title=\"Image:Dark-wizardry.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Dark-wizardry.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Dark-wizardry.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Dark_Wizardry\" title=\"Dark Wizardry\">Dark Wizardry</a>\n</td><td>Mage\n</td><td>15\n</td><td>80\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">Increases all Shadow Damage\n</td><td>No\n</td><td>Shadow\n</td><td>12\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Fire-resistance.png\" title=\"Image:Fire-resistance.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Fire-resistance.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Fire-resistance.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Fire_Resistance\" title=\"Fire Resistance\">Fire Resistance</a>\n</td><td>Mage\n</td><td>20\n</td><td>varies\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">Increases Fire Resistance\n</td><td>No\n</td><td>Fire\n</td><td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Ice-resistance.png\" title=\"Image:Ice-resistance.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Ice-resistance.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Ice-resistance.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Ice_Resistance\" title=\"Ice Resistance\">Ice Resistance</a>\n</td><td>Mage\n</td><td>20\n</td><td>varies\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">Increases Ice Resistance\n</td><td>No\n</td><td>Ice\n</td><td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Skill-_On_The_Rocks.png\" title=\"Image:Skill-_On_The_Rocks.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Skill-_On_The_Rocks.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Skill-_On_The_Rocks.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/On_The_Rocks\" title=\"On The Rocks\">On The Rocks</a>\n</td><td>Mage\n</td><td>3\n</td><td>25\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">Bill becomes stationary. Enemy Attack Speed and Movement Speed Reduced within 7 meters.\n</td><td>No\n</td><td>Ice\n</td><td>35\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Skill-_Nippy_Twigs.png\" title=\"Image:Skill-_Nippy_Twigs.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Skill-_Nippy_Twigs.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Skill-_Nippy_Twigs.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Nippy_Twigs\" title=\"Nippy Twigs\">Nippy Twigs</a>\n</td><td>Mage\n</td><td>1\n</td><td>30\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\"><a class=\"missing\" href=\"/wiki/Chill_Bill\" title=\"Chill Bill\">Chill Bill</a>'s attacks have increased damage, may reduce Attack Speed and Movment Speed and may Knockdown.\n</td><td>No\n</td><td>Ice\n</td><td>31\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Pyromania.png\" title=\"Image:Pyromania.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Pyromania.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Pyromania.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Pyromania\" title=\"Pyromania\">Pyromania</a>\n</td><td>Mage\n</td><td>15\n</td><td>80\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">Increases all Fire Damage\n</td><td>No\n</td><td>Fire\n</td><td>12\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Shadow-resistance.png\" title=\"Image:Shadow-resistance.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Shadow-resistance.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Shadow-resistance.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Resistance\" title=\"Shadow Resistance\">Shadow Resistance</a>\n</td><td>Mage\n</td><td>20\n</td><td>varies\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">Increases Shadow Resistance\n</td><td>No\n</td><td>Shadow\n</td><td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Skill-_Snow_Globe.png\" title=\"Image:Skill-_Snow_Globe.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Skill-_Snow_Globe.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Skill-_Snow_Globe.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Snow_Globe\" title=\"Snow Globe\">Snow Globe</a>\n</td><td>Mage\n</td><td>5\n</td><td>30\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\"><a class=\"missing\" href=\"/wiki/Chill_Bill\" title=\"Chill Bill\">Chill Bill</a> gets Max Health increase. Melee attacks on Bill may reduce attacker Movement Speed and Attack Speed.\n</td><td>No\n</td><td>Ice\n</td><td>33\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Spontaneous_Rengeration.png\" title=\"Image:Spontaneous_Rengeration.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Spontaneous_Rengeration.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Spontaneous_Rengeration.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Spontaneous_Re-Generation\" title=\"Spontaneous Re-Generation\">Spontanueous<br/>Re-Generation</a>\n</td><td>Mage\n</td><td>5\n</td><td>80\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">Rengerates Mana\n</td><td>No\n</td><td>N/A\n</td><td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Teleport.png\" title=\"Image:Teleport.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Teleport.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Teleport.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Teleport\" title=\"Teleport\">Teleport</a>\n</td><td>Mage\n</td><td>2\n</td><td>varies\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">Warp to line-of-sight location\n</td><td>No\n</td><td>N/A\n</td><td>50\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
